[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 362.53, "timestamp": "00:06:02", "text": "今天魯迪被替換了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 365.029, "timestamp": "00:06:05", "text": "[音樂]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 399.27, "timestamp": "00:06:39", "text": "好。歡迎進來。他們說當我被一個充滿愛心的[音樂] sem 擊中時。  是的。上車。沒事的。  只是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 401.749, "timestamp": "00:06:41", "text": "擦傷而已。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 404.55, "timestamp": "00:06:44", "text": "你比這更堅強。  只是擦傷而已，兄弟。  好的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 409.43, "timestamp": "00:06:49", "text": "。  好的。好的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 411.67, "timestamp": "00:06:51", "text": "。我總是這樣，因為它仍然是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 413.189, "timestamp": "00:06:53", "text": "靜音的。"}]